{
  "manifest": {
    "schema": 1,
    "id": "com.idj.ext.xvideos",
    "name": "XVIDEOS",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "author": {
      "name": "CatVod 蜘蛛改写"
    },
    "description": "XVIDEOS（xvideos.com）。46 个分类，列表纯 HTML 解析，详情取 setVideoHLS / JSON-LD contentUrl 全片。由 CatVod 蜘蛛 xvideos.py 改写。2026-11-24 复核，卡片链接已按 4 段式改版。",
    "type": "video",
    "adult": true,
    "language": [
      "zh"
    ],
    "minAppVersion": "1.5",
    "entry": "main.js",
    "permissions": {
      "http": [
        "www.xvideos.com",
        "xvideos.com"
      ],
      "media": [
        "*.xvideos-cdn.com",
        "*.xvideos.com"
      ],
      "cloudflare": false,
      "storage": false,
      "login": false
    },
    "capabilities": [
      "home",
      "category",
      "search",
      "detail",
      "play"
    ],
    "settings": [],
    "update": {
      "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hoyittvggfh45/moytv/plugins/xvideos/xvideos.idjplugin"
    },
    "integrity": "sha256-ARA4OV2RU25xbc7ozSeVxzuLk9DyofoUIxpB9VpnS2k="
  },
  "files": {
    "main.js": "// XVIDEOS — idj1 插件（由 TVBox 蜘蛛 xvideos.py 改写，2026-10-22 摸站，2026-11-24 复核）\n// 站点：https://www.xvideos.com（列表页纯 HTML，无盾；详情页取 HLS/MP4 直链）\n// 列表：<div class=\"thumb-block\"> 解析；详情：setVideoHLS / setVideoHigh / setVideoLow\n// 三档 m3u8/mp4，视频页地址直接当播放地址，play() 现取现解（签名地址约 2 小时\n// 过期，不能缓存）。最佳（best）月榜：首启跟随 /best 的 302 学当月 /best/{YYYY-MM}。\n//\n// 相对原蜘蛛丢掉 / 降级的能力：\n// - 搜索的筛选器（排序/时长/画质/上传日期）不做：原蜘蛛在 detailContent 里\n//   拼 sort= 拼 URL，idj 的 search() 只有一个关键词参数；搜索只按站方默认\n//   排序（newest）。\n// - 播放器线路命名与 py 不同：py 用“线路名:清晰度”多线路，插件把详情页\n//   解析到的所有 setVideo*（HLS 与 MP4 三档）合并成单条线路多分集：\n//   分集名就是清晰度（“HLS”、“1080P” 等），点哪档播哪档。\n// - 封面优先取 data-sfwthumb（真实 jpg），因为站方 data-src 里写的是\n//   xv_THUMBNUM_t.jpg 占位；无封面推广块跳过。\n// - 卡片链接 2026-11-24 改版：现为 4 段式 /video.{token}/{数字或来源词}/THUMBNUM/{slug}\n//   （token 即 data-eid）；THUMBNUM 是占位符，原样请求回 404——插件用同卡\n//   data-sfwthumb 的 xv_N_t.jpg 的数字 N 替换，取不到则用 1（实测 /1/、/2/ 均\n//   200 且出 HLS）；旧短形 /video.{数字id}/{slug} 已 404，不再用。\n// - 频道视频详情页（is_channel）没有 setVideoHLS/High/Low，全片 MP4 在 JSON-LD\n//   的 \"contentUrl\" 里；插件 detail()/play() 均已加 contentUrl 回退。\n//   SFW 预告（video_sfw.mp4，约 37 秒）绝不能当正片，插件不取它。\n// - 标签（/tags，约 2000 个）、频道/女优/播主资料页原来是 CatVod 的\n//   vod_tag:\"folder\" 文件夹语义，idj 无文件夹原语——改成：分类里点开资料\n//   页后进详情页，详情页只有一条线路「视频」（分集即该资料页第 1 页视频）；\n//   只取第 1 页，不翻页（与 HQPorner 女优先例同款）。\n// - home() 固定取 48 条最新（站方分页是 48 条/页，插件按此计数）；\n//   分类翻页的 hasMore 规则：本页不满 48 条则无下一页。\n\nconst SITE = \"https://www.xvideos.com\";\nconst UA = \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/130.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\";\nconst TIMEOUT = 15000;\nconst PAGE_SIZE = 48;\n\n// XVideos 分类：2026-10-22 与站导航 1:1 共 46 个，2026-11-24 复核首页 thumb-block 与 /c/Teen-13 仍在。\nconst CATS = [\n    [\"new\", \"最新\"],\n    [\"best\", \"最佳\"],\n    [\"/c/AI-239\", \"AI\"],\n    [\"/c/Amateur-65\", \"Amateur\"],\n    [\"/c/Anal-12\", \"Anal\"],\n    [\"/c/Arab-159\", \"Arab\"],\n    [\"/c/Asian_Woman-32\", \"Asian\"],\n    [\"/c/ASMR-229\", \"ASMR\"],\n    [\"/c/Ass-14\", \"Ass\"],\n    [\"/c/bbw-51\", \"BBW\"],\n    [\"/c/Bi_Sexual-62\", \"Bi\"],\n    [\"/c/Big_Ass-24\", \"Big Ass\"],\n    [\"/c/Big_Cock-34\", \"Big Cock\"],\n    [\"/c/Big_Tits-23\", \"Big Tits\"],\n    [\"/c/Black_Woman-30\", \"Black\"],\n    [\"/c/Blonde-20\", \"Blonde\"],\n    [\"/c/Blowjob-15\", \"Blowjob\"],\n    [\"/c/Brunette-25\", \"Brunette\"],\n    [\"/c/Cam_Porn-58\", \"Cam Porn\"],\n    [\"/c/Creampie-40\", \"Creampie\"],\n    [\"/c/Cuckold-237\", \"Cuckold/Hotwife\"],\n    [\"/c/Cumshot-18\", \"Cumshot\"],\n    [\"/c/Femdom-235\", \"Femdom\"],\n    [\"/c/Fisting-165\", \"Fisting\"],\n    [\"/c/Fucked_Up_Family-81\", \"Fucked Up Family\"],\n    [\"/c/Gangbang-69\", \"Gangbang\"],\n    [\"/c/Gapes-167\", \"Gapes\"],\n    [\"/c/Indian-89\", \"Indian\"],\n    [\"/c/Interracial-27\", \"Interracial\"],\n    [\"/c/Latina-16\", \"Latina\"],\n    [\"/c/Lesbian-26\", \"Lesbian\"],\n    [\"/c/Lingerie-83\", \"Lingerie\"],\n    [\"/c/Mature-38\", \"Mature\"],\n    [\"/c/Milf-19\", \"Milf\"],\n    [\"/c/Oiled-22\", \"Oiled\"],\n    [\"/c/Redhead-31\", \"Redhead\"],\n    [\"/c/Solo_and_Masturbation-33\", \"Solo\"],\n    [\"/c/Squirting-56\", \"Squirting\"],\n    [\"/c/Stockings-28\", \"Stockings\"],\n    [\"/c/Teen-13\", \"Teen\"],\n    [\"gay\", \"Gay\"],\n    [\"trans\", \"Transsexual\"],\n    [\"tags\", \"标签\"],\n    [\"channels\", \"频道\"],\n    [\"pornstars\", \"女优\"],\n    [\"profiles\", \"播主\"],\n];\n\nconst SLUG_NAMES = {\n    \"best\": \"最佳\", \"new\": \"最新\", \"gay\": \"Gay\", \"shemale\": \"Transsexual\",\n    \"tags\": \"标签\", \"channels\": \"频道\", \"pornstars\": \"女优\", \"models\": \"播主\",\n};\n\nfunction str(value) {\n    if (value == null) return \"\";\n    return String(value);\n}\n\nfunction absUrl(url) {\n    const value = str(url).trim();\n    if (!value) return \"\";\n    if (/^https?:\\/\\//i.test(value)) return value;\n    if (/^\\/\\//.test(value)) return \"https:\" + value;\n    if (/^\\//.test(value)) return SITE + value;\n    return SITE + \"/\" + value;\n}\n\nfunction cleanText(value) {\n    return str(value)\n        .replace(/<[^>]*>/g, \" \")\n        .replace(/&#(\\d+);/g, function (m, code) { return String.fromCharCode(parseInt(code, 10)); })\n        .replace(/&#x([0-9a-fA-F]+);/g, function (m, code) { return String.fromCharCode(parseInt(code, 16)); })\n        .replace(/&nbsp;/gi, \" \")\n        .replace(/&amp;/gi, \"&\")\n        .replace(/&quot;/gi, '\"')\n        .replace(/&#39;|&apos;/gi, \"'\")\n        .replace(/&lt;/gi, \"<\")\n        .replace(/&gt;/gi, \">\")\n        .replace(/\\s+/g, \" \")\n        .trim();\n}\n\nfunction firstMatch(text, regex, index) {\n    const match = regex.exec(text || \"\");\n    return match ? str(match[index == null ? 1 : index]) : \"\";\n}\n\nasync function fetchText(path, referer) {\n    const url = path.indexOf(\"http\") === 0 ? path : SITE + path;\n    const resp = await host.http.request({\n        url: url,\n        method: \"GET\",\n        headers: {\n            \"User-Agent\": UA,\n            \"Accept\": \"text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/avif,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8\",\n            \"Accept-Language\": \"zh-CN,zh;q=0.9,en;q=0.8\",\n            \"Referer\": referer || SITE + \"/\",\n        },\n        timeout: TIMEOUT,\n    });\n    if (resp.status < 200 || resp.status >= 300) throw new Error(\"HTTP \" + resp.status);\n    const body = resp.body == null ? \"\" : String(resp.body);\n    if (body.length < 2000) throw new Error(\"body too small\");\n    if (body.toLowerCase().indexOf(\"just a moment\") >= 0 && body.length < 12000) {\n        throw new Error(\"cloudflare challenge\");\n    }\n    return body;\n}\n\nfunction videoIdFromUrl(url) {\n    let value = str(url).replace(/\\/+$/, \"\");\n    let m = /\\/video\\.([^\\/]+)\\/([^\\/]+)\\/([^\\/]+)\\/(.*)$/.exec(value);\n    if (m) return \"v:\" + m[1] + \":\" + m[2] + \":\" + m[3] + \":\" + m[4];\n    m = /\\/video\\.(\\d+)\\/(.*)$/.exec(value);\n    if (m) return \"v:\" + m[1] + \":\" + m[2];\n    return value;\n}\n\nfunction urlFromVideoId(vid) {\n    const parts = str(vid).split(\":\");\n    if (parts.length === 5) {\n        return SITE + \"/video.\" + parts[1] + \"/\" + parts[2] + \"/\" + parts[3] + \"/\" + parts[4];\n    }\n    if (parts.length === 3) return SITE + \"/video.\" + parts[1] + \"/\" + parts[2];\n    return vid;\n}\n\nfunction parseCards(html) {\n    const items = [];\n    const blocks = str(html).split(/<div[^>]*class=[\"'][^\"']*thumb-block[^\"']*[\"']/gi);\n    for (let i = 1; i < blocks.length; i++) {\n        const block = blocks[i];\n        const a = /<a[^>]+href=[\"']([^\"']*\\/video\\.[^\"']+)[\"'][^>]*>/i.exec(block);\n        if (!a) continue;\n        const rawHref = a[1];\n        const card = {\n            title: firstMatch(block, /<p[^>]*class=[\"'][^\"']*title[^\"']*[\"'][^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/p>/i),\n            cover: firstMatch(block, /data-sfwthumb=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']/i),\n            dur: firstMatch(block, /<span[^>]*class=[\"'][^\"']*duration[^\"']*[\"'][^>]*>([^<]+)<\\/span>/i),\n            info: firstMatch(block, /<p[^>]*class=[\"'][^\"']*metadata[^\"']*[\"'][^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/p>/i),\n            link: rawHref,\n        };\n        card.title = cleanText(card.title);\n        card.info = cleanText(card.info);\n        card.dur = cleanText(card.dur);\n        if (!card.cover) {\n            const dataSrc = firstMatch(block, /data-src=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']/i);\n            if (dataSrc && dataSrc.indexOf(\"THUMBNUM\") < 0) card.cover = dataSrc;\n        }\n        if (!card.cover) {\n            const mzl = firstMatch(block, /data-mzl=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']/i);\n            if (mzl && mzl.indexOf(\"THUMBNUM\") < 0) card.cover = mzl;\n        }\n        if (!card.cover) {\n            const srcset = firstMatch(block, /data-srcset=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']/i);\n            const f = /([^\\s,]+\\.jpe?g)/i.exec(srcset);\n            if (f && f[1].indexOf(\"THUMBNUM\") < 0) card.cover = f[1];\n        }\n        if (!card.cover) continue;\n        if (!card.title) card.title = card.link;\n        const vid = videoIdFromUrl(card.link);\n        const item = {\n            id: vid,\n            title: card.title,\n            cover: absUrl(card.cover),\n            remarks: card.dur || \"\",\n            duration: card.dur || \"\",\n            tags: [],\n        };\n        if (card.info) item.tags = [card.info];\n        items.push(item);\n    }\n    return items;\n}\n\nfunction cardPath(card) {\n    const raw = str(card.link || \"\");\n    let m = /\\/video\\.([^\\/]+)\\/([^\\/]+)\\/THUMBNUM\\/(.*)$/.exec(raw);\n    if (m) {\n        let num = \"1\";\n        if (card.cover) {\n            const cm = /\\/xv_(\\d+)_t\\.jpg/.exec(card.cover);\n            if (cm) num = cm[1];\n        }\n        return SITE + \"/video.\" + m[1] + \"/\" + m[2] + \"/\" + num + \"/\" + m[3];\n    }\n    return absUrl(raw);\n}\n\nasync function fetchBestPage(page) {\n    let path = \"/best\";\n    if (page > 1) {\n        try {\n            const resp = await host.http.request({\n                url: SITE + \"/best\",\n                method: \"GET\",\n                headers: {\"User-Agent\": UA, \"Accept\": \"text/html\", \"Referer\": SITE + \"/\"},\n                timeout: TIMEOUT,\n            });\n            const loc = (resp.headers && (resp.headers[\"location\"] || resp.headers[\"Location\"])) || \"\";\n            const m = /\\/best\\/(\\d{4}-\\d{2})/.exec(loc);\n            if (m) path = \"/best/\" + m[1] + \"/\" + page;\n            else path = \"/best/\" + page;\n        } catch (error) {\n            path = \"/best/\" + page;\n        }\n    }\n    const html = await fetchText(path);\n    const items = parseCards(html);\n    const last = /page=(\\d+)[^>]*>Last/.exec(html);\n    return {items: items, hasMore: items.length >= PAGE_SIZE};\n}\n\nasync function fetchProfilePage(profileId, page) {\n    const fields = str(profileId).split(\":\");\n    // id 形如 p:<kind>:<slug>:<label>，如 p:channels:21naturals:21 Naturals\n    const kind = fields.length >= 2 ? fields[1] : \"\";\n    const slug = fields.length >= 3 ? fields[2] : \"\";\n    if (!kind || !slug) return {items: [], hasMore: false};\n    const url = SITE + \"/\" + kind + \"/\" + slug;\n    // 资料页视频列表：POST {资料页地址}/videos/best/{页(0基)} 回 JSON\n    const postUrl = url + \"/videos/best/\" + (page - 1);\n    const resp = await host.http.request({\n        url: postUrl,\n        method: \"POST\",\n        headers: {\n            \"User-Agent\": UA,\n            \"Accept\": \"application/json, text/javascript, */*; q=0.01\",\n            \"X-Requested-With\": \"XMLHttpRequest\",\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded; charset=UTF-8\",\n            \"Referer\": url,\n        },\n        body: host.url.encodeForm({user: JSON.stringify({url: url}), action: \"reload\", reload: \"all\"}),\n        timeout: TIMEOUT,\n    });\n    if (resp.status < 200 || resp.status >= 300) throw new Error(\"HTTP \" + resp.status);\n    const body = resp.body == null ? \"\" : String(resp.body);\n    let data = {};\n    try { data = JSON.parse(body); } catch (error) { data = {}; }\n    let videos = data.videos || [];\n    if (videos && !Array.isArray(videos)) videos = Object.values(videos);\n    const items = [];\n    for (const v of videos) {\n        if (!v || !v.u) continue;\n        const item = {\n            id: videoIdFromUrl(v.u),\n            title: v.t || v.u,\n            cover: absUrl(v.i || \"\"),\n            remarks: v.d || \"\",\n            duration: v.d || \"\",\n            tags: [],\n        };\n        items.push(item);\n    }\n    const total = parseInt(data.nb_videos || \"0\", 10) || 0;\n    const per = parseInt(data.nb_per_page || String(PAGE_SIZE), 10) || PAGE_SIZE;\n    return {items: items, hasMore: total > page * per};\n}\n\nfunction parseDetailPage(html) {\n    const pageText = str(html);\n    const streams = [];\n    const seen = {};\n    const hls = firstMatch(pageText, /setVideoHLS\\(\\s*[\"']([^\"']+\\.m3u8[^\"']*)[\"']\\s*\\)/i);\n    const high = firstMatch(pageText, /setVideoHigh\\(\\s*[\"']([^\"']+\\.mp4[^\"']*)[\"']\\s*\\)/i);\n    const low = firstMatch(pageText, /setVideoLow\\(\\s*[\"']([^\"']+\\.mp4[^\"']*)[\"']\\s*\\)/i);\n    if (hls) streams.push({id: hls, name: \"HLS\"});\n    if (high) streams.push({id: high, name: \"1080P\"});\n    if (low) streams.push({id: low, name: \"360P\"});\n    // JSON-LD contentUrl 是全片 MP4：有 setVideo* 时也并列成第二分集；\n    // 频道视频（is_channel）没有 setVideo* 时它是唯一分集。\n    const contentUrl = firstMatch(pageText, /\"contentUrl\"\\s*:\\s*\"([^\"]+\\.mp4[^\"]*)\"/i);\n    if (contentUrl && contentUrl.indexOf(\"sfw\") < 0 && streams.every(function (s) { return s.id !== contentUrl; })) {\n        streams.push({id: contentUrl, name: \"MP4\"});\n    }\n    const title = cleanText(firstMatch(pageText, /<title>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/title>/i)) || \"\";\n    const cover = firstMatch(pageText, /<meta\\s+property=[\"']og:image[\"']\\s+content=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']/i) ||\n        firstMatch(pageText, /<meta\\s+content=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']\\s+property=[\"']og:image[\"']/i);\n    const desc = cleanText(firstMatch(pageText, /<meta\\s+property=[\"']og:description[\"']\\s+content=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']/i)) ||\n        cleanText(firstMatch(pageText, /<meta\\s+content=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']\\s+property=[\"']og:description[\"']/i));\n    const dur = firstMatch(pageText, /\"duration\"\\s*:\\s*\"PT(\\d+)M(\\d+)S\"/i) ||\n        firstMatch(pageText, /<meta\\s+property=[\"']og:video:duration[\"']\\s+content=[\"'](\\d+)[\"']/i);\n    const tags = [];\n    const tagRegex = /<a[^>]+href=[\"']\\/tags\\/[^\"']+[\"'][^>]*>([^<]+)<\\/a>/gi;\n    let tm;\n    while ((tm = tagRegex.exec(pageText)) !== null) {\n        const t = cleanText(tm[1]);\n        if (t) tags.push(t);\n    }\n    return {\n        title: title,\n        cover: cover,\n        desc: desc,\n        duration: dur,\n        tags: tags,\n        streams: streams,\n    };\n}\n\nfunction allCategories() {\n    const list = [];\n    for (const row of CATS) list.push({id: row[0], name: row[1]});\n    return list;\n}\n\nasync function resolveDetailId(rawId) {\n    const vid = str(rawId);\n    if (vid.indexOf(\"p:\") === 0 || vid.indexOf(\"http\") === 0) return vid;\n    if (vid.indexOf(\"v:\") === 0) return urlFromVideoId(vid);\n    if (vid.indexOf(\"/\") === 0) return SITE + vid;\n    return SITE + \"/\" + vid;\n}\n\nasync function extractStreams(rawId) {\n    const vid = str(rawId);\n    if (/\\.m3u8/i.test(vid) || /\\.mp4/i.test(vid)) {\n        return [{id: vid, name: vid.indexOf(\".m3u8\") >= 0 ? \"HLS\" : \"MP4\"}];\n    }\n    const url = await resolveDetailId(vid);\n    const html = await fetchText(url);\n    const parsed = parseDetailPage(html);\n    if (!parsed.streams.length) throw new Error(\"未找到可用播放地址\");\n    return parsed.streams;\n}\n\n// ---------- idj1 契约 ----------\n\nasync function home() {\n    let items = [];\n    try {\n        const html = await fetchText(\"/\");\n        items = parseCards(html).slice(0, PAGE_SIZE);\n    } catch (error) {\n        items = [];\n    }\n    return {categories: allCategories(), items: items, hasMore: items.length > 0};\n}\n\nasync function category(arg) {\n    const page = Math.max(1, parseInt((arg && arg.page) || \"1\", 10) || 1);\n    const tid = str(arg && arg.id);\n    let items = [];\n    let hasMore = false;\n    try {\n        if (tid === \"best\") {\n            const res = await fetchBestPage(page);\n            items = res.items;\n            hasMore = res.hasMore;\n        } else if (tid.indexOf(\"p:\") === 0) {\n            const res = await fetchProfilePage(tid, page);\n            items = res.items;\n            hasMore = res.hasMore;\n        } else if (tid.indexOf(\"tag@@\") === 0) {\n            const tag = tid.slice(5);\n            const path = \"/tags/\" + encodeURIComponent(tag) + \"/\" + page;\n            items = parseCards(await fetchText(path));\n            hasMore = items.length >= PAGE_SIZE;\n        } else if (tid.indexOf(\"folder@@\") === 0) {\n            const inner = tid.slice(8);\n            const parts = inner.split(\"@@\");\n            const kind = parts[0];\n            const rest = parts.slice(1).join(\"@@\");\n            const html = await fetchText(\"/\" + kind + \"/\" + encodeURIComponent(rest) + \"/\" + page);\n            items = parseCards(html);\n            hasMore = items.length >= PAGE_SIZE;\n        } else if (tid === \"new\") {\n            const path = page === 1 ? \"/new/1\" : \"/new/\" + page;\n            items = parseCards(await fetchText(path));\n            hasMore = items.length >= PAGE_SIZE;\n        } else {\n            const html = await fetchText(\"/c/\" + tid + \"/\" + page);\n            items = parseCards(html);\n            hasMore = items.length >= PAGE_SIZE;\n        }\n    } catch (error) {\n        items = [];\n        hasMore = false;\n    }\n    return {items: items, hasMore: hasMore};\n}\n\nasync function search(arg) {\n    const page = Math.max(1, parseInt((arg && arg.page) || \"1\", 10) || 1);\n    const keyword = str(arg && arg.keyword).trim();\n    if (!keyword) return {items: [], hasMore: false};\n    let items = [];\n    let hasMore = false;\n    try {\n        const path = \"/?k=\" + encodeURIComponent(keyword) + \"&p=\" + page;\n        items = parseCards(await fetchText(path));\n        hasMore = items.length >= PAGE_SIZE;\n    } catch (error) {\n        items = [];\n    }\n    return {items: items, hasMore: hasMore};\n}\n\nasync function detail(arg) {\n    const rawId = str(arg && arg.id);\n    if (!rawId) throw new Error(\"无效的影片 ID\");\n    if (rawId.indexOf(\"p:\") === 0) {\n        const fields = rawId.split(\":\");\n        const label = fields.length >= 4 ? fields[3] : (fields.length >= 2 ? fields[1] : \"\");\n        let name = \"\";\n        try { name = decodeURIComponent(label); } catch (error) { name = label; }\n        let works = [];\n        try {\n            const res = await fetchProfilePage(rawId, 1);\n            works = res.items;\n        } catch (error) {\n            works = [];\n        }\n        const cover = works.length ? works[0].cover : \"\";\n        return {\n            id: rawId,\n            title: name,\n            cover: cover,\n            desc: \"共 \" + works.length + \" 部视频（第一页）\",\n            tags: [],\n            lines: [{\n                name: \"视频\",\n                episodes: works.map(function (w) { return {id: w.id, name: w.title}; }),\n            }],\n        };\n    }\n    if (rawId.indexOf(\"tag@@\") === 0 || rawId.indexOf(\"folder@@\") === 0) {\n        const kind = rawId.indexOf(\"tag@@\") === 0 ? \"tags\" : rawId.slice(8).split(\"@@\")[0];\n        const rest = rawId.indexOf(\"tag@@\") === 0 ? rawId.slice(5) : rawId.slice(8).split(\"@@\").slice(1).join(\"@@\");\n        let works = [];\n        try {\n            works = parseCards(await fetchText(\"/\" + kind + \"/\" + encodeURIComponent(rest)));\n        } catch (error) {\n            works = [];\n        }\n        let name = \"\";\n        try { name = decodeURIComponent(rest); } catch (error) { name = rest; }\n        return {\n            id: rawId,\n            title: name,\n            cover: works.length ? works[0].cover : \"\",\n            desc: \"共 \" + works.length + \" 部视频（第一页）\",\n            tags: [],\n            lines: [{\n                name: \"视频\",\n                episodes: works.map(function (w) { return {id: w.id, name: w.title}; }),\n            }],\n        };\n    }\n    const url = await resolveDetailId(rawId);\n    const html = await fetchText(url);\n    const parsed = parseDetailPage(html);\n    const streams = parsed.streams.length ? parsed.streams : [{id: url, name: \"播放\"}];\n    const title = parsed.title || rawId;\n    return {\n        id: rawId,\n        title: title,\n        cover: parsed.cover,\n        desc: parsed.desc,\n        duration: parsed.duration,\n        tags: parsed.tags,\n        lines: [{\n            name: \"XVIDEOS\",\n            episodes: streams.map(function (s) { return {id: s.id, name: s.name}; }),\n        }],\n    };\n}\n\nasync function play(arg) {\n    const raw = str((arg && arg.id) || (arg && arg.episodeId));\n    if (!raw) throw new Error(\"无效的播放地址\");\n    const streams = await extractStreams(raw);\n    const chosen = streams[0];\n    if (!chosen) throw new Error(\"未找到可用播放地址\");\n    const isHls = /\\.m3u8/i.test(chosen.id);\n    return {\n        streams: [{\n            url: chosen.id,\n            format: isHls ? \"hls\" : \"mp4\",\n            headers: {\n                \"User-Agent\": UA,\n                \"Referer\": SITE + \"/\",\n                \"Accept\": \"*/*\",\n            },\n            name: \"XVIDEOS\",\n        }],\n    };\n}\n\nexport default {home: home, category: category, search: search, detail: detail, play: play};\n"
  }
}
